config RADIO_CSR
	tristate "CSR SDIO Radio Char driver"
	depends on MMC
	default y
	help
	  Choose Y here if you have the CSR tuneX

	  To complier this drver as a module, choose M here:
	  the module will be called radio-csr
	  the driver only transfer data and access register
 	  between the chip and SDR service


